{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/extras/9f9300a76f4713d3fe230797d15eb34a.avif?t=1764130598\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Time Game is a complex strategy card-game where you can bend the rules of time to outsmart your opponents!\u00a0 Play solo or online with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love Magic: The Gathering, or complex card games with card stacking mechanics, this is for you. Join our weekly multiplayer events on Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards each turn, trying to survive deadly weapons and bombs. Cards stack up creating a complex chain of events, requiring you to predict future outcomes. Certain spaces on the board can give advantages while others will send you on an impromptu space-walk. Time is bent and logical strategy is created in the moment depending on the game state. The depth is seen in the course of rounds you survive in, resulting in a fight over abundant parts of the map while avoiding dangerous locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, 2-4 Players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Board that changes each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out how the future will unfold by creating rifts in time and deploying time bombs as future explosives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize futuristic technology such as time machines, rocketships, as well as cryogenic chambers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Busted Cards From Spaces In Time, use them to tilt the scales in your favour.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Master Puzzler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/4950982f4ac483b21cd0739c350cde5e9ba524e5.jpg"},{"name":"Hyperspace Bypass ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/7427b3e9139c2ff0f818f6d15b866ffd2d03475b.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/33400dab4669a93b0ac7f7a4b4b421d00dee84fb.jpg"},{"name":"Llama Farmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/d8caeabd4bc230810ab9a4b293c376e689d24a2f.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/3d46210843d65ccfbd5cfb28e170dfa20a3e33ad.jpg"},{"name":"Everything Everywhere All at Once","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/f48d5918150e3f97881ed66a49d663ea5b4f3ee4.jpg"},{"name":"Reading the card explains the card","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/2fa6da44a69d5213c3f9acf1c1e5c5cd8964bc93.jpg"},{"name":"What is real?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/e64e16c676c69c088caef81e1da6acd13633dcf6.jpg"},{"name":"Rocks and a Tincan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/7a056e1232bdc8219c641eecdca955db274ac00c.jpg"},{"name":"Shock Nature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2865190/c5dc1c16f45039b90fe69c3551bd5c56216b24d8.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865190?t=1764130598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865190?t=1764130598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/0e997fe1a947b72571144a420c7b97c19a94b582/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764130598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/0e997fe1a947b72571144a420c7b97c19a94b582/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764130598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/extras/9f9300a76f4713d3fe230797d15eb34a.avif?t=1764130598\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Time Game is a complex strategy card-game where you can bend the rules of time to outsmart your opponents!\u00a0 Play solo or online with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love Magic: The Gathering, or complex card games with card stacking mechanics, this is for you. Join our weekly multiplayer events on Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards each turn, trying to survive deadly weapons and bombs. Cards stack up creating a complex chain of events, requiring you to predict future outcomes. Certain spaces on the board can give advantages while others will send you on an impromptu space-walk. Time is bent and logical strategy is created in the moment depending on the game state. The depth is seen in the course of rounds you survive in, resulting in a fight over abundant parts of the map while avoiding dangerous locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer, 2-4 Players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Board that changes each game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out how the future will unfold by creating rifts in time and deploying time bombs as future explosives. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize futuristic technology such as time machines, rocketships, as well as cryogenic chambers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Busted Cards From Spaces In Time, use them to tilt the scales in your favour.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Kai","Myles","Finn","Logan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865190/b8313efc656d45228f3e2d341d35f18a17e22f86/header.jpg?t=1764130598","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7200U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2865190/1254479913/f96b4f7242cb1342fe8af43224c785f9885dfd5d/1759812002/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760135440","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2865190/1254479913/f96b4f7242cb1342fe8af43224c785f9885dfd5d/1759